**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery & Dish Retrieval**

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Target Condition / Enquired Info** | **Relation** | **Justification** |
|----------|----------|-------------|---------------|--------------------------------------|--------------|-------------------|
| **G1** | Provide food delivery service to inpatient rooms | `;` | Perform | – | Root | The service consists of two sequential stages (food delivery → dish retrieval). |
| **G2** | Deliver meal to patient | `FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2)` | Perform | – | AND (to G1) | Both delivery and dish retrieval must succeed for the service. The fallback captures the two possible delivery modes. |
| **G2.1** | Deliver meal to table | `;` | Perform | – | AND (to G2) | Delivery to table is a two‑step process. |
| **G2.1.1** | Place meal on patient’s table | `-` | Perform | – | AND (to G2.1) | Concrete action that actually places the food. |
| **G2.1.2** | Monitor patient retrieval of placed meal | `-` | Perform | – | AND (to G2.1) | Robot must observe if the patient takes the meal; if not, fallback to tray‑fetch. |
| **G2.2** | Fetch meal from robot’s tray | `;` | Perform | – | AND (to G2) | Fetching requires two sub‑steps. |
| **G2.2.1** | Query if patient can retrieve from tray | `-` | Query | “Can patient retrieve from tray?” | AND (to G2.2) | Need to know if the patient can use the tray before attempting help. |
| **G2.2.2** | Assist patient in retrieving meal from tray | `-` | Perform | – | AND (to G2.2) | Robot physically assists the patient (or companion/nurse). |
| **G3** | Retrieve dirty dishes from patient room | `;` | Perform | – | AND (to G1) | Dish retrieval is a separate, mandatory step after food delivery. |
| **G3.1** | Open patient room door | `FALLBACK(G3.1.1, G3.1.2)` | Perform | – | AND (to G3) | Door can be opened by robot alone or with human/robot assistance. |
| **G3.1.1** | Open door with robot alone | `-` | Perform | – | OR (to G3.1) | Robot may be able to open the door by itself. |
| **G3.1.2** | Open door with human or another robot | `-` | Perform | – | OR (to G3.1) | If robot cannot open, it must cooperate with a human or another robot. |
| **G3.2** | Retrieve dishes | `FALLBACK(G3.2.1, G3.2.2)` | Perform | – | AND (to G3) | Dish retrieval can be unassisted or require cooperation. |
| **G3.2.1** | Retrieve dishes unassisted | `-` | Perform | – | OR (to G3.2) | Robot may handle all dishes alone. |
| **G3.2.2** | Retrieve dishes with cooperation | `-` | Perform | – | OR (to G3.2) | If unassisted is impossible, robot must cooperate. |

